Messages.Body:
@Brandon: Sorry you think that way... It was a shot in the dark. THN seems like a discipline that should have all sorts of interesting potential but doesn't meet it and NEC is basically "Block Fails & Shambling Hordes"... Maybe Dead Hand if you're pushing it and the odd recycling shennanigans with a Soul-Gem Turbo type deck.

@James:
Sure, but isn't it always the problem of getting them into torpor? You could do something Baltimore Purge related, but then you're going to get some genuine table hate and Samedi can't really defend themselves. All Kudos to someone who can get Yong Sun to work... I've wanted to make a Yong Sun deck to exploit his text and they seem to die quickly or you lose Yong Sun to AI.

Retired Baron of Sydney, Australia, 418
